## 🛡️ **Security & Compliance Checklist (Final Review)**

| Requirement | Status | Verification Method |
|-----------|--------|---------------------|
| SSE-KMS enforced | ✅ | `ServerSideEncryption: aws:kms` in code & IaC |
| No hardcoded keys | ✅ | Only IAM roles + KMS aliases used |
| KMS key policy allows S3 access | ✅ | IAM policy includes `kms:Encrypt`, `kms:Decrypt` |
| CI/CD validation in place | ✅ | `cfn-lint` / `cdk synth` check added |
| Unit test verifies headers | ✅ | Test confirms presence of `aws:kms` |
| Bucket not public | ✅ | `blockPublicAccess: BLOCK_ALL` |

